        "y1": 0.324091516359888
      },
      "text": "neighbor of u. We say that a vertex v ∈ V (G) \\ D is D-defended if there exists a vertex u ∈ N (v) ∩ D",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
