        "x1": 0.8941216562308517,
        "y1": 0.34287901598997794
      },
      "text": "Specifically, we say that v ∈ V (G) \\ D is D-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11765099818410438,
        "y0": 0.3478929009100403,
        "x1": 0.8939243890101614,
        "y1": 0.36166701653991085
      },
      "text": "defended by a vertex u if u ∈ N (v) ∩ D and (D \\ {u}) ∪ {v} is a dominating set of G. We note that",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
